.env
.env.*

# Haia Trace local store. A `.trace/` at the repo root is only ever scratch — this
# repo builds the tool, it doesn't record operations with it — so the whole thing
# goes, including anything left behind by exercising the CLI from here.
/.trace/

# Under examples/ (and anywhere else) only the derived halves go. `.trace/templates/`
# is source a project authors and should commit, so it is deliberately kept. `**/`
# because a pattern with an inner slash would otherwise anchor to the repo root.
**/.trace/events/
**/.trace/receipts/

# Hackathon submission working files (video plan, slides) — temporary, not part of the product
hackathon/
